<title>USA: U-Ship to install UPS centers in Canada.</title>
<headline>U-Ship to install UPS centers in Canada.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>U-Ship Inc said Tuesday it reached an agreement with United Parcel Service Canada to install its automated shipping centers in UPS Canada's retail service counters.</p>
<p>Financial terms of the agreement were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The contract is for three years and includes the installation of 10 centers, U-Ship said.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
